Test? Paper? Class discussion? Don't worry, we have you covered. This book has everything you need. Not only does it feature the complete text of Pride and Prejudice, it offers a comprehensive study guide that will help you easily understand Austen's classic novel. You'll make the grade with:
) Complete and unabridged text 
) Scene-by-scene summaries 
) Explanations and discussions of the plot
) Question-and-answer sections 
) Austen biography ) List of characters and more 
Check out doverpublications.com for more Dover Thrift Study Editions and to access free analytical essay outlines. 
--back cover

